 "description": "Use this when the user asks what a specific Pok\u00e9mon card is worth or has sold for, raw or graded. One card as its pokefocus.com page shows it: TCGplayer market price with 7- and 30-day change, eBay sold medians and sale counts for raw, PSA 9, and PSA 10, active listing count, and the verified recent eBay sales for one grade, newest first, with the median the card page shows.",
